:: Carter House Leaving Early High Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */
You stretch your arms into the air as you take a step towards the front door, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> seemingly knowing your intention before you say anything as his expression falls and he asks <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Are you leaving already? But we’re having so much fun!”</span> He frowns much like your little brother Noah does when you tell him playtime is over. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“It’s not that late yet, you could stay a little longer…”</span> He glances down, already knowing your answer. <br>
<br>
You apologize but tell <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> it is time for you to go. You have other stuff you have to do and places you have to be. He can’t deny that your time spent together was fun and you’ll be sure to come back soon to hang out some more. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Fine.”</span> He sighs, puffing out his cheeks, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But you have to come back sometime this week! Or we have to like go somewhere or something later this week. You already said it so you can’t back down!”</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Carter",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Happy",

            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> smiles, <span style="Color: LightGreen">his disappointment at you leaving overshadowed by his own enjoyment of spending time with you today.</span> He walks you out to the street before bidding farewell. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Bye, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$CarterNickname</span>. I’ll see you at school!”</span> You wave goodbye and walk down the street to wherever the day leads you next. <br>
